# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# SECRETS - never let these reach GitHub
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
# Streamlit's local secrets file. On the deployed app you paste secrets into
# the Secrets box instead; this file is only ever for testing on your machine.
.streamlit/secrets.toml
*.key
*.pem

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# TOO BIG FOR GITHUB
# GitHub refuses any single file over 100 MB. This deck is about 154 MB.
# Leaving it out costs nothing at search time: its slides and pictures are
# already inside chroma_store, and the app never reopens a deck once indexed.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# No leading path, so this matches the deck wherever it sits - there is a copy
# in sample_assets AND another at the top of the project.
DA vs DS vs DE.pptx

# Anything else that would blow the limit. Add names here if they appear.
*.pptx.bak

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Python junk
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# NOTE: chroma_store/ and index_status.json are deliberately NOT ignored.
# They are the ready-made search index, and the deployed app needs them in
# order to search without re-indexing anything.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
